  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Control and eradication of rabies - IV phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  subject  of  the  contract  is  the  supply, delivery  and  distribution  by  the  contractor  of  t1,680,000  vaccine  baits  for  the  vaccination  of  red  fox  against  rabies  across  the  whole territory  of  Albania  (excluding  urban  areas  and  water  bodies)  in  three  consecutive  rounds to take place during the period  2022 - 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
